{"title":"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/5469cd9253fe22cfc3fa04199bbd71f3ddca6d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz = 10^{81}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/8218bca78e7c28184110014241386cd0f3993fdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_{10}x)(\\log_{10} yz) + (\\log_{10}y) (\\log_{10}z) = 468$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"340\" height=\"18\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f96660a95321ddf8e7db5edcbdfbcdf8b3b69bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt {(\\log_{10}x)^2 + (\\log_{10}y)^2 + (\\log_{10}z)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"278\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the properties of logarithms, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/2/f9269ef5a09b551176c09b128ef5b6629804ed5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}xyz = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"17\" /> by taking the log base 10 of both sides, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff3ad1e9d297d3908ac5b516cfd7521b2efae1a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_{10}x)(\\log_{10}y) + (\\log_{10}x)(\\log_{10}z) + (\\log_{10}y)(\\log_{10}z)= 468$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"482\" height=\"18\" /> by using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45f230dd914ab9596ed0c85b8f069665f3175a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}ab = \\log_{10}a + \\log_{10}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"205\" height=\"19\" />. \n</p><p>Through further simplification, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26f40c9e5a3aebc7666c2d486db901e3a07bde72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}x+\\log_{10}y+\\log_{10}z = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"236\" height=\"17\" />. It can be seen that there is enough information to use the formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/291b55e2553af52fdcf7ee9c3aa5dc593561d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ (a+b+c)^{2} = a^{2}+b^{2}+c^{2}+2ab+2ac+2bc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"358\" height=\"19\" />, as we have both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/0/230e1fb9e15c00fab06f4866e12e9ac729bee752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ a+b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c62b2c4ab31333d858ca26e61e27722bde4e34a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ 2ab+2ac+2bc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"128\" height=\"14\" />, and we want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef645be1e1b920a5823e3a6f383824ee94930196.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt {a^2 + b^2 + c^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>After plugging in the values into the equation, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/a/83a83ce9d8ff0c713ba4b2f7fdc1d6e30f3f6e6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ (\\log_{10}x)^2 + (\\log_{10}y)^2 + (\\log_{10}z)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"264\" height=\"19\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adf34be65c507ea31055700c278efaba355b0547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ 6561 - 936 = 5625$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"154\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>However, we want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f96660a95321ddf8e7db5edcbdfbcdf8b3b69bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt {(\\log_{10}x)^2 + (\\log_{10}y)^2 + (\\log_{10}z)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"278\" height=\"32\" />, so we take the square root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/5/e85cc1c03375589b7bfd33a1ae9045169befdca6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ 5625$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/1/df14dc0a48e96b291bea5a4eb29a84e6dd44f85a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{075}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/2/8c249eadaad62da5531e7df6f98ee95a4e0284b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\log_{10}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/093bf3ccb46a1bbdb28773d83209787ca66ca2a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\log_{10}y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce425060da135e5f71bb12f797492c8ecf3c5499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\log_{10}z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd72638ca5080c518ceecbe9c06b0f4128febd20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb844c7e24575350f6258213cb1c7eea62711b50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(b+c)+bc=ab+ac+bc=468$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"272\" height=\"20\" />. Since these two equations look a lot like Vieta's for a cubic, create the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/d/79d096aba3e60a40379050a1897453603477d86e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-81x^2+468x=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" /> (leave the constant term as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to make things easy). Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c4199517573d03284f3f72ec87bd73a011b67317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-81x+468=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now we use the quadratic formula:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b1193ae886391733ef64410c19498e74784b554.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{81\\pm\\sqrt{81^2-4\\cdot468}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"193\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9ab25c9682337059b3ae467154869f30090624f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{81\\pm\\sqrt{4689}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc4e8da7c1d1c134ba8d8f103965e295c4476080.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{81+3\\sqrt{521}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"43\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a176e75260d03d2b6803714a88bd124df4e5885d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{81-3\\sqrt{521}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Since the question asks for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66edd9d946b1cd58b2595414a1dbf13a1a657b62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />  (remember one of the values was the solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> that we divided out in the beginning), we find:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b0b04be88c86329649a302d86064b0dd1493caa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{81+3\\sqrt{521}}{2}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{81-3\\sqrt{521}}{2}\\right)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"306\" height=\"66\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/b/1db45868ce8b3a052b69f1b466c36aebd7a8d7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{2\\cdot\\frac{81^2+(3\\sqrt{521})^2}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"186\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/4/6d4bf0f7a5829b7819fbb5ab76a931ba70d6bdfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{\\frac{11250}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"88\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/e/aee56f3f10ece218b699f262a4e75494b5373d24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{075}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~bad_at_mathcounts\n</p><p>An easier approach from  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd72638ca5080c518ceecbe9c06b0f4128febd20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb844c7e24575350f6258213cb1c7eea62711b50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(b+c)+bc=ab+ac+bc=468$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"272\" height=\"20\" /> would be just squaring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd72638ca5080c518ceecbe9c06b0f4128febd20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />.\n~SwordAxe\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution\">Video solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ix6czB_A_Js&amp;t\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ix6czB_A_Js&amp;t</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II\" title=\"2010 AIME II\">2010 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017222225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 286/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7925/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.925      1 -total\n 56.62%    7.885      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.78%    5.539      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8635:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017222225 and revision id 291808. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}